{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48791","headline":"九城寻山水 · 薛曜","name":"九城寻山水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"菊浦桃源瞰九城，鸾歌凤啸忽将迎。\n千岩杂树云霞色，百道流泉风雨声。\n上客由来轩盖重，幽人自觉薜萝轻。\n疑是昔年栖息地，山中日暮有余情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}